        "question_type": "Practical",
        "exam_year": "2017",
        "question_text": "<p>A non-profit organization received subscriptions of \u20b512,000 during the year. Subscriptions in arrears at the beginning and end of the year were \u20b52,000 and \u20b53,000, respectively. What is the amount of subscriptions income for the year?</p>",
